{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ROCK-PAPER-SCISSOR... WITH CARDS!?!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/2eb00f49a3c41b441ef019e651ed4a53.poster.avif?t=1758595108\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/2eb00f49a3c41b441ef019e651ed4a53.webm?t=1758595108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is here to reinvent the classic game of rock-paper-scissor and turn it in a Deck-builder Roguelike where you will fight against a lot of enemies with one objective in mind, retrieve your life and escape off the hands of the Collector.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/06857e7ebc816e23efc9c7269fff877a.poster.avif?t=1758595108\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/06857e7ebc816e23efc9c7269fff877a.webm?t=1758595108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use up to five rings at the same time to buff your cards and elevate the level of your deck to the next level, and also use all the abilities that your cards has to build strange but powerful synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Rings to change the whole flow of the battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities to combo with your cards and even with your Rings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special synergies between legendary cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy with your hand as you will only be capable o using 5 rings at the same time!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/1751fdde17fd9c3abe45d8cb94fd5522.poster.avif?t=1758595108\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/1751fdde17fd9c3abe45d8cb94fd5522.webm?t=1758595108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A million ways to plays means a lot, but really a lot of cards to add to your deck and create a powerful deck able to defeat the collector and get back your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abnormal amount of cards to choose of!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limit in the deck!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different styles = different decks to build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/34bd0a4e33639a50d2b83eced75bbc76.poster.avif?t=1758595108\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/34bd0a4e33639a50d2b83eced75bbc76.webm?t=1758595108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/34bd0a4e33639a50d2b83eced75bbc76.mp4?t=1758595108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will enter battles against powerful enemies in a BO3 style, see your hand, select a trio of cards to battle inside the round and then let the magic happens, with your rings and abilities you will discover the power to reach the top and get your ultimate reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/0f2f8e7937b3bfadcc24fccc0636f3ca.poster.avif?t=1758595108\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/0f2f8e7937b3bfadcc24fccc0636f3ca.webm?t=1758595108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delightful colors\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise Pixel-art\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality and love poured in every sprite!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997250?t=1758595108","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997250?t=1758595108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/c9470d199849e99c4b9d663ac90225cb3a358d6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758595108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/c9470d199849e99c4b9d663ac90225cb3a358d6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758595108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ROCK-PAPER-SCISSOR... WITH CARDS!?!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/2eb00f49a3c41b441ef019e651ed4a53.poster.avif?t=1758595108\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997250/extras/2eb00f49a3c41b441ef019e651ed4a53.webm